# U52: the list beside the build list (BuildList.lua:93, getPublicBuilds) with its dead draw
# body run on both sides (`#! u52-draw-body`). Frame 1 draws the Trending list (portraits only
# for the lower-case ascendancies, long titles and skills wrapped, the stats line, Import and
# Preview buttons for the builds inside the view, re-created every frame at `#controls + 1`).
# Then: hover an Import button; Preview of the first build (OpenURL); a click on the list's empty
# area (the focus leaves the build list) and the wheel (the scroll bar moves the content, the
# buttons and the status line; back to the top); the "Latest" tab ("Loading.." for a frame, then the Latest list; the tab buttons'
# `locked` flags swap); Import of the first Latest build (ImportBuild: pobb.in, DownloadBuild,
# the build code decoded, main:SetMode("BUILD", false, "Latest Hierophant", xml, false, url)).
#! u52-setup list
#! u52-draw-body
#! expect-text Righteous Fire Juggernaut
#! expect-text Loading..
#! expect-text Latest Hierophant
#! u52-expect-effect open-url https://pobarchives.com/build/aB3dE5
#! u52-expect-mode BUILD
#! u52-expect-build-name Latest Hierophant
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
fixture net=net.json
frames 3
move 1150 250
frames 1
move 1200 250
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
move 1250 460
click LEFTBUTTON
wheel down 3
frames 2
wheel up 1
frames 1
wheel up 3
frames 1
move 1206 69
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 1150 215
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
